■ INTUITUM
PROJECT: DIFFUSE

///

CONTACT: SUPPORT@INTUITUM.SH
LOCATION: USA
STATUS: ONLINE

///

OVERVIEW:
 - Self-hosted GitHub pull-request review.
 - Pins the exact pull-request head and repository context.
 - Runs bounded, read-only Codex and Claude Code CLI investigations.
 - Verifies candidate findings before publishing a review and GitHub Check.

///

V1 BOUNDARY:
 - Diffuse is a review product, not a general-purpose agent platform.
 - It does not auto-approve, mutate branches, or promise to find every defect.
 - The repository still contains transitional code from an earlier direction.

FLOW:
 PULL REQUEST -> CONTEXT -> INVESTIGATION -> VERIFICATION -> REVIEW + CHECK

///

LICENSE:
 Source-available under BSL 1.1; free to use, modify, and self-host.
 Do not offer Diffuse itself as a hosted or managed service.
 Converts to Apache-2.0 in 2030 (see LICENSE).

